This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Its subject is the KEEPALIVE block of .githooks/pre-push -- the distribution's own gate,
which install.sh never ships. The consumer's pre-push is core/git-hooks/pre-push, a
different program that does not carry this block, so on a consumer these arms would be
asserting against a file that is not there.
